---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import ProcessPipeline from "../components/ProcessPipeline.astro";
import { sitePath } from "../site-path";
---

<SiteLayout
  title={"VSTEP Q&A Bot · Ace Nguyen"}
  description={"A bilingual VSTEP exam assistant developed for Club’s Week. See the chat interface and how it finds a relevant answer."}
  bodyClass="case-study-page"
>
  <main id="main" class="project-page">
    <section class="case-intro wrap" aria-labelledby="case-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Club’s Week · September 2024</p>
        <h1 id="case-title">VSTEP Q&amp;A Bot<span class="blue">.</span></h1><p class="case-deck">A place to ask exam questions in two languages.</p></div>
      <div class="case-context"><p>I built this browser-based assistant for Club’s Week. Students could type a question about the Vietnamese Standardized Test of English Proficiency in Vietnamese or English.</p>
        <dl><div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>Browser-based chat</dd></div><div><dt>My work</dt><dd>JavaScript interface and Flask integration with substantial AI-assisted code generation</dd></div></dl></div>
    </section>
    <nav class="chapter-nav wrap" aria-label="Project sections"><a href="#chat">Chat interface</a><a href="#retrieval">Answer flow</a><a href="#example">FAQ example</a></nav>
    <section class="wrap chapter" id="chat">
      <div class="chapter-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Chat interface</p><h2>Ask in the language you use.</h2></div>
      <div class="chapter-prose"><p>Students can send a question with Enter or the send button. Their message appears immediately. A typing indicator stays on screen while a reply is being prepared, and the conversation scrolls to the newest message.</p></div>
      <a class="evidence wide bot-image" href={sitePath("assets/work/vstep.webp")} aria-label="Enlarge the Club’s Week chat interface"><img src={sitePath("assets/work/vstep.webp")} width="1632" height="850" alt="The VSTEP welcome message and question field beside the Greenwich AI Innovation Community logo and robot mascot." loading="lazy"></a>
    </section>
    <section class="structure" id="retrieval"><div class="wrap chapter">
      <div class="chapter-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Answer lookup</p><h2>From an exam FAQ to a reply.</h2></div>
      <div class="chapter-prose"><p>At startup, Flask loads the Excel workbook and builds a separate TF-IDF index for each language. Both sheets contain 30 questions. All 30 English rows and 25 Vietnamese rows have an answer.</p>
      <p>Each request sends one question. Gemini receives that question and the selected FAQ answer, with instructions to stay on VSTEP topics and reply in the detected language.</p></div>
      <ProcessPipeline label="VSTEP question and answer flow" steps={[
        { label: "Send", title: "Question to Flask", description: "The browser posts the typed question to /query/ and shows a typing indicator." },
        { label: "Route", title: "Greeting or FAQ", description: "Messages containing recognized greetings such as “hello” or “xin chào” get a canned reply. Other messages go to the FAQ lookup." },
        { label: "Match", title: "Closest question", description: "A check for Vietnamese characters selects the sheet. The bot compares TF-IDF scores by cosine similarity and takes the top result." },
        { label: "Reply", title: "Gemini response", description: "The matched answer and original question become the model context. The reply appears in the chat." },
      ]} />
      <p class="flow-note">The character check can send unaccented Vietnamese to the English sheet. The lookup always takes the top row, even if the match is weak or its answer cell is blank.</p>
    </div></section>
    <section class="wrap chapter" id="example">
      <div class="chapter-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Workbook example</p><h2>What goes into a reply?</h2></div>
      <div class="chapter-prose"><p>This example uses the English sheet and the bot’s matching logic. The selected answer is the workbook text passed to Gemini.</p>
      <p class="project-actions"><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/npqace/CW-Chatbot">Explore the code on GitHub</a></p></div>
      <dl class="flow-details flow-example">
        <div><dt>Student question</dt><dd>What does the acronym VSTEP stand for?</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Matched FAQ question</dt><dd>What does VSTEP stand for?</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Matched workbook answer</dt><dd>VSTEP stands for Vietnamese Standardized Test of English Proficiency.</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer wrap"><a href={sitePath("vietjusticia-platform.html")}>Explore the VietJusticIA platform</a><a href={sitePath("#work")}>All work</a></footer>
</SiteLayout>
